# Keep local installs, build output and secrets out of Docker build
# contexts (apps/collab/Dockerfile builds with pnpm-monorepo as context).
# Everything in here is recreated inside the image by pnpm install and the
# build step — copied-in local state would shadow it (e.g. macOS symlinks
# into node_modules/.pnpm, or a stale tsconfig.tsbuildinfo making tsc skip
# its emit).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated
**/.env
**/.env.*
